     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"#000000\">Dear MSstats users,</font><div><font size=\"2\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font><div><font size=\"2\" color=\"#000000\">First, I&#39;m happy to announce our recent publications in Bioinformatics about MSstats R-package and external tools in Skyline. Now they are available in online. </font></div><div><font size=\"2\" color=\"#000000\">1. <span style=\"line-height:17px\">M. Choi et al. &quot;</span><a href=\"http://bioinformatics.oxfordjournals.org/content/early/2014/05/02/bioinformatics.btu305.abstract\" style=\"line-height:17px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioinformatics.oxfordjournals.org/content/early/2014/05/02/bioinformatics.btu305.abstract&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232618620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mxRMZD9CR9VyisMH3vEYf\">MSstats: an R package for statistical analysis for quantitative mass spectrometry-based proteomic experiments.</a><span style=\"line-height:17px\">&quot; Bioinformatics (2014), DOI: 10.1093/bioinformatics/btu305</span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\">2. </span><span style=\"line-height:17px\">D. Broudy and T.Killeen et al. &quot;</span><a href=\"http://bioinformatics.oxfordjournals.org/content/early/2014/05/09/bioinformatics.btu148.abstract\" style=\"line-height:17px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bioinformatics.oxfordjournals.org/content/early/2014/05/09/bioinformatics.btu148.abstract&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232618621000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0EO-yApScOWBp-mej5QDhH\">A framework for installable external tools in Skyline</a><span style=\"line-height:17px\">.&quot; Bioinformatics (2014), DOI: 10.1093/bioinformatics/btu148 </span></font></div><div><br></div><div><font size=\"2\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\">Second, If you already had a plan to visit ASMS 2014 in Baltimore, please join us at Summer <a href=\"https://skyline.gs.washington.edu/labkey/project/home/software/Skyline/events/2014%20User%20Group%20Meeting%20at%20ASMS/begin.view?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://skyline.gs.washington.edu/labkey/project/home/software/Skyline/events/2014%2520User%2520Group%2520Meeting%2520at%2520ASMS/begin.view?&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232618621000&amp;usg=AOvVaw12EJySlAOKXVRwepz7Rzw_\">Skyline User Group Meeting</a> (Sunday, June 15th, 2014 - registration required) as well. I will have 20 mins presentation about overview of MSstats and our group will be there also. I hope that we have a chance to meet you and hear your feedback and suggestion.</span></font></div></div><div><font size=\"2\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\">-- Meena</span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"line-height:17px\"><br></span></font></div></div>"
    ]
